{"version":1,"name":"SAVE\\SAVGAMA.DAT","data":"","leads":[{"id":"council-commissions","title":"Council commissions","detail":"Rolf says to read the proclamations at City Hall and ask the clerk about commissions."},{"id":"phlan-training-schools","title":"Training in New Phlan","detail":"Rolf showed the party where adventurers train. Return to the training schools when a character is ready to advance."},{"id":"phlan-paid-rest","title":"Paid lodging in New Phlan","detail":"The lodging on the south side of New Phlan costs one platinum. Pay for a stay to rest and memorize spells."},{"id":"harbor-trade","title":"The sea lanes","detail":"Rolf says few ships risk the passage and the council wants to reopen it."},{"id":"phlan-training-directions","title":"Training school directions","detail":"From the notices, go north to train magic users or clerics. Go east to train fighters or rogues."},{"id":"phlan-training-north","title":"Doors at the northern training school","detail":"From the sign, use the east door for magic users and the west door for clerics."},{"id":"phlan-training-clerics","title":"Cleric training door","detail":"Use the west door at the northern training school. Accept the trainer's offer, select the cleric, then choose Train Character."},{"id":"phlan-training-fee","title":"Training costs 1,000 gold","detail":"The trainer quoted a fee of 1,000 gold. Check the selected character's coins and experience under View Character before returning."},{"id":"phlan-training-experience","title":"More experience needed","detail":"The trainer refused advancement for lack of experience. Earn more XP and check the character's progress under View Character."},{"id":"phlan-sune-healing","title":"Healing at the Temple of Sune","detail":"Priestess Joy of Sune offers healing in New Phlan."},{"id":"commission-ohlo","title":"Fetch Ohlo's potion - turned in","detail":"Ohlo drank his potion and settled the reward.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"ohlo-rope-guild-entry","title":"The Rope Guild entrance","detail":"The party found the notice just north of the entrance to the Old Rope Guild."},{"id":"ohlo-rope-guild","title":"The Old Rope Guild","detail":"The party entered the former Rope Guild in the Slums."},{"id":"ohlo-booth","title":"The Rope Guild booth","detail":"The man in the booth says he has nothing to sell."},{"id":"ohlo-package-received","title":"The Rope Guild package","detail":"The booth merchant gave the party a package after hearing Ohlo's name. Bring it back to Ohlo."},{"id":"ohlo-delivered","title":"Ohlo drank the potion","detail":"Ohlo drank the potion, grew younger, and offered the promised reward."},{"id":"proclamation-lxiv","title":"Proclamation LXIV","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lxxviii","title":"Proclamation LXXVIII","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-cix","title":"Proclamation CIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"proclamation-lix","title":"Proclamation LIX","detail":"The party recorded this council proclamation. Its text is in the Adventurer's Journal."},{"id":"commission-slums","title":"Clear the Slums - turned in","detail":"The council acknowledged the result.","status":"turned-in"},{"id":"commission-sokal","title":"Clear Sokal Keep - offered","detail":"Find passage to Thorn Island, clear the keep, and report to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"commission-records","title":"Recover records of old Phlan - offered","detail":"Search the old city for historical records and bring worthwhile finds to the clerk.","status":"offered"},{"id":"commission-auction","title":"Investigate the auction - accepted","detail":"If you're still in New Phlan, ask the harbor master about passage toward Podal Plaza. Observe the auction, identify the weapon, and report to the clerk.","status":"accepted"},{"id":"phlan-arena-recruits","title":"Adventuring partners in New Phlan","detail":"The arena master can introduce adventurers who take a share of the party's treasure."},{"id":"phlan-training-fighters","title":"Fighter training door","detail":"Go east past the arena in New Phlan, then take the north door marked Fighters. Accept the trainer's offer and select Train Character."}],"party":{"SAVE\\CHRDATA1.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA1.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA1.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATA2.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA2.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA2.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATA3.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA3.ITM":"C0xvbmcgU3dvcmQgU3dvcmQgICAgICAgICAgICAxNQAAAAAAAAAAAAAACADiPCQAACQAAAEAADwAAA8AAAAADSBZZXMgIFNoaWVsZCAgICAgICAgICAgICAgICAxNQAAAAAAAAAAAAAACADmPDsAADsAAAEAAGQAAA8AAAAADEJhbmRlZCBNYWlsICBNYWlsICAgICAgICAgICA5MAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADkAMDkAAAEAAF4BAFoAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATA3.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATA4.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA4.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA5.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA5.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA5.SPC":"fAAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATA6.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA6.ITM":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA6.SPC":"awAA/wAAAAAA","SAVE\\CHRDATA7.SAV":"","SAVE\\CHRDATA7.ITM":"AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAACACsPxcAABcAAAEAADIAAAMAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAADoAMDoAAAEAAMIBAJABAAAA"},"automap":{"0":{"cells":{"11,2":{"x":11,"y":2,"walls":[1,0,13,0]},"5,2":{"x":5,"y":2,"walls":[0,12,0,0]},"4,3":{"x":4,"y":3,"walls":[0,0,11,0]},"1,4":{"x":1,"y":4,"walls":[13,0,5,0]},"0,4":{"x":0,"y":4,"walls":[0,0,4,1]},"2,4":{"x":2,"y":4,"walls":[0,0,4,0]},"2,3":{"x":2,"y":3,"walls":[0,0,0,4]},"2,2":{"x":2,"y":2,"walls":[4,0,0,4]},"3,2":{"x":3,"y":2,"walls":[4,0,0,0]},"4,2":{"x":4,"y":2,"walls":[0,0,0,0]},"5,3":{"x":5,"y":3,"walls":[0,0,0,0]},"6,3":{"x":6,"y":3,"walls":[2,0,0,0]},"7,3":{"x":7,"y":3,"walls":[4,0,0,0]},"7,4":{"x":7,"y":4,"walls":[0,13,0,0]},"7,5":{"x":7,"y":5,"walls":[0,0,0,8]},"7,6":{"x":7,"y":6,"walls":[0,13,0,6]},"7,7":{"x":7,"y":7,"walls":[0,0,